{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114327","id":3129304631,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66hWY3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114327.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114327","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114327/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114327/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114327/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/871a0cb7fadc0c74abe9dc72f5c620bf6b8d5047","number":114327,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[MacOS] Fix non-deterministic framework linking order on macOS for incremental builds","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Issue\r\nOn macOS, the order of `-framework` flags in LINKFLAGS can vary between builds due to the use of unordered data structures for `extra_frameworks`. This causes the flags string generated from the SCons environment to change on every build invocation, even when there are no actual configuration changes.\r\n\r\nFor module developers using external build systems (like Rake) that consume these flags, this results in:\r\n- Unnecessary regeneration of external build configuration files\r\n- Loss of incremental build capabilities for the external system\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1456\" height=\"946\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5623f092-554f-4ba9-881b-a6bf2eb4324f\" />\r\n<img width=\"1664\" height=\"228\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75f29463-b532-4941-b4f6-02632717ee07\" />\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nSort the `extra_frameworks` list before generating the framework linker flags to ensure a deterministic order.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# Before\r\nframeworks = [item for key in extra_frameworks for item in [\"-framework\", key]]\r\n\r\n# After\r\nframeworks = [item for key in sorted(extra_frameworks) for item in [\"-framework\", key]]","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"nod